{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process, Course Packet Information Received should be sent"
      ],
      "justification": "Implicitly starts the process and models the initial notification step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "followed by sending the Design to Faculty."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly captures the second sequential step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After sending the Design to Faculty, the Faculty will choose the design."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately models the faculty selection action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, identify the content that requires copyright clearance and contact the publisher to obtain clearance."
      ],
      "justification": "Splits a compound instruction into two equivalent sequential actions, preserving behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7",
        "guard:b1->n9",
        "guard:b1->n8",
        "action:n8",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued. However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the first decision point. n7 performs the check, b1 splits the flow, the guards abstract the Yes/No outcome to the cleared/denied paths, and n8/n9 execute the respective branches."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match to the margin addition step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11",
        "guard:b2->n13",
        "guard:b2->n12",
        "action:n12",
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued. Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized, then the MPC should notify the Bookstore"
      ],
      "justification": "Models the second decision point regarding price finalization vs. reconsideration, with correct branching logic and terminal notification."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "and the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures process termination. The converge node provides necessary structural plumbing for the loop-back flows implied by 'continue the process'."
    }
  ],
